  "content": "[vc_row][vc_column][vc_empty_space][eikra-vc-text-title style=\"style2\" title=\"Freeship / Scholarship for AY 2022 -23\"]<span style=\"color: #000000;\">The scheme aims to provide freeship /scholarship to 50 students getting admission at 1-year level, in appreciation of their outstanding achievements in academic, co-curricular, sports and extra-curricular activities.</span>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Sl No.</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">CET Ranking or PCM %</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Tuition Fee Concession*</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">College Fee Concession**</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Transportation Fee Concession**</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Remarks</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1 to 5000</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Free</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Free</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Free</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">For all 4 Years</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">2</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">5001 to 10000 or &gt;95%in PCM</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">50%</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">50%</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">50%</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">For all 4 Years</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">3</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">10001 to 20000 or &gt;90%in PCM</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">25%</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">25%</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">25%</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">For all 4 Years</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">4</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">20001 to 25000</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">25%</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">25%</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">25%</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">For First 2 Years</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">5</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">25001 to 35000</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">25%</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">25%</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">25%</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\">First year only</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n&nbsp;\n\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Note:</strong> <strong>*</strong>Tuition fee concession is extended only for direct admission under management quota. <strong>•</strong> This concession fee will be extended for 50 students on first come first serve basis. <strong>•</strong> Please contact college for more on terms and conditions.</span>[/eikra-vc-text-title][vc_empty_space][/vc_column][/vc_row]"
